        "exp": "• Tam giác SAB vuông tại A: SA = a<span class=\"sqrt\"><span class=\"rad\">√</span><span class=\"radicand\">3</span></span>, AB = a ⇒ SB = <span class=\"sqrt\"><span class=\"rad\">√</span><span class=\"radicand\">SA² + AB²</span></span> = <span class=\"sqrt\"><span class=\"rad\">√</span><span class=\"radicand\">3a² + a²</span></span> = 2a.<br>• Trong tam giác vuông SAB: cos(SBA) = <span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"numerator\">AB</span><span class=\"denominator\">SB</span></span> = <span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"numerator\">a</span><span class=\"denominator\">2a</span></span> = <span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"numerator\">1</span><span class=\"denominator\">2</span></span> (góc SBA = 60°).<br>• Góc giữa hai vectơ: (<span class=\"vec\"><svg class=\"vec-arr\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 82 2 L 98 10 L 82 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"vec-sym\">SB</span></span>, <span class=\"vec\"><svg class=\"vec-arr\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 82 2 L 98 10 L 82 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"vec-sym\">AB</span></span>) = 180° - SBA? Chú ý: <span class=\"vec\"><svg class=\"vec-arr\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 82 2 L 98 10 L 82 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"vec-sym\">BS</span></span> và <span class=\"vec\"><svg class=\"vec-arr\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 82 2 L 98 10 L 82 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"vec-sym\">BA</span></span> có chung gốc B, góc giữa chúng là góc SBA = 60°.<br>Vectơ <span class=\"vec\"><svg class=\"vec-arr\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 82 2 L 98 10 L 82 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"vec-sym\">SB</span></span> = -<span class=\"vec\"><svg class=\"vec-arr\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 82 2 L 98 10 L 82 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"vec-sym\">BS</span></span> ⇒ cos(<span class=\"vec\"><svg class=\"vec-arr\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 82 2 L 98 10 L 82 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"vec-sym\">SB</span></span>, <span class=\"vec\"><svg class=\"vec-arr\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 82 2 L 98 10 L 82 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"vec-sym\">AB</span></span>) = cos(-<span class=\"vec\"><svg class=\"vec-arr\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 82 2 L 98 10 L 82 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"vec-sym\">BS</span></span>, -<span class=\"vec\"><svg class=\"vec-arr\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 82 2 L 98 10 L 82 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"vec-sym\">BA</span></span>) = cos(<span class=\"vec\"><svg class=\"vec-arr\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 82 2 L 98 10 L 82 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"vec-sym\">BS</span></span>, <span class=\"vec\"><svg class=\"vec-arr\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M 82 2 L 98 10 L 82 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"vec-sym\">BA</span></span>) = cos 60° = <b>1/2</b>."
